{"version":1,"content":"<p>當公司的最大IP、領導者、創始人帶來了信任危機，誰來接管這家明星公司？當地時間11月8日，英偉達創始人兼CEO黃仁勳向公司員工發送道歉信，承認自己有婚外情，隨後英偉達董事會啓動獨立調查。雖然英偉達發言人已對外明確黃仁勳將繼續擔任公司CEO，履職不會中斷，但市場仍對後續黃仁勳職責、英偉達控制權是否變化有所疑慮。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585648.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.388050+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T15:26:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:33:58.536548+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"f827304c958bffbe95950fadbe0480e0c06fb6f50e4ee31bddeec9419ede01a4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}